  "visible_text": "LAMPWRIGHT'S PROGRAM / ISOMETRIC ROOFTOP\nProgram the lampwright to light every marked rooftop tile; use reusable routines and choose J whenever the next block changes height.\n\nRead the stepped blocks. Build a reusable route, then watch the robot execute it.\n\nLAMPS\n5/5\nLIVE ROOFTOP MAP \u00b7 HEIGHTS ARE REAL\n1\n5\n3\n2\n4\nROOFTOP SECTOR / 6e13d13cebfd\n unlit target\n stepped block\n robot heading\nICON EDITOR \u00b7 DRAG INTO A SLOT\nF\nFORWARD\nL\nLEFT\nR\nRIGHT\nJ\nJUMP\nG\nLIGHT\nA\nAMBER\nB\nBLUE\nMAIN PROCEDURE\n8/8\nA\nR\nB\nL\nA\nR\nB\n\u00b7\nAMBER ROUTINE\n6/6\nG\nF\nF\nJ\nF\nG\nBLUE ROUTINE\n6/6\nF\nR\nF\nJ\nF\nG\nRUN PROGRAM\nCERTIFY\nPASS \u2014 ROOFTOP LIT\nPASS\n\nF climbs no height. J crosses one visible step. A and B reuse the same routine from a new heading.\n\nORDINARY INPUT ONLY \u00b7 EDIT, RUN, OBSERVE, REVISE\nROUTE LICENSE 6e13d13cebfd"
